      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f7dc1b09e1037d9a7a4e058ea6ea6b489a832214825775418cd382fb3ce90eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa0c27c7d7fd76bec72771ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走咯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "167c476ae4e50740d222867d26ce1988fafb946c30ad3f608beb919ca0d564f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:249179a83821dad611a3e075",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f067f48da199e272fcff687fcdf4c651840778b12461e92a3b2f3daffefaa1f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c09384dbd53c2184beaa83a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "758a23ba3b4ff252a4e5eac29e32085c8aaa84f0e672e96ad91d5390fb0aa06e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc335bf984870184b0955ef8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天似乎是准备了这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97258ed0616c31d9415f88c71fc99aab9ea0a5c3f4d6759347af3f48ff43a493",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81adf9b4c562f3d08c7ce6cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉头晕晕的……\r\n是体力达到极限了吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4b7b15747b83c4f3231f48ce7066272e542462ac6137af467fb8910706425f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908dbbea9f34e9c0ccd6d83e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……感觉脚好重。\r\n看来今天是需要休息了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e752b627210e0a0acccda578564a2df1ce335d35b0944d10e43efb2f7ea5c86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c582925536cf957b3168bba1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉充满了力量……！\r\n这是锻炼的好机会，开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c345ea002937169a275dd08f1b69ee497888b8a6a86f833d14ca9e9c4ec53c8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:016ef51fb393a8a37f76909d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉真不错。\r\n无论是什么样的训练项目，\r\n应该都能有令人满意的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fbac4bad9fd636f0900bd59c317742da11cfbf5a2e40c3668995a069fd8ef57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:787c3ff26ef456117f4f1420",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许是因为度过了很平静的一天，\r\n现在感觉相当不错。\r\n这样就能全力投入训练了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf86299f8bc31748d34c3a946d6e0a33e60ccc4f3e540909251ad80e6076f788",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:613cd2c6a711f320a60b4807",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体很轻盈……\r\n感觉能通过训练得到不少收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfaf1b28bc24c0315d8cc99a9db3b0f7fd473c58452186476a47b2d9c26be49d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2dde277cc542201116cb93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么问题，\r\n感觉能像平时一样完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cabe7cd34397b9e25494692b44c262a2f5845f3aff4b1878be8701ddbcd3974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b50d7f653fd13e1a4f8776dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要随时保持平常心\r\n就不会出什么问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af15dc8b774192dea85fe05ba7de3f4678cbe4ce399f369769460e60d3c74848",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34802d4240481ec472b522d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉身体很不协调……",
      "source_fingerprint": "548383a1f1eca461ad055652d7a57d447c06a22cc50b5eca69c6017b8c4a173f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32791f8852916be0cae78b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "应该要燃起斗志……\r\n这道理我也明白，但……呼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5bfe37fbdb84daffaf4f22ae98ac8975702b6a3ce568977147838d23031ad94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8c28f4dd0ba41b52d6e724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从早上开始状态就不好……\r\n不，这并不是你的错，别在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87545e033a30bff40c3822e9a585ebe92e4c81e360b02a70fe2b680e1040446c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2855435294219738c8f35fe9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……感觉身体很沉重。\r\n虽然明白不能这样下去……\r\n但也不知道该怎么办……",
      "source_fingerprint": "acb8701921dd8321d68cab9cadcfe40be2204ea16934e513d9b545a3370d71e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e03f2cc6be9bb458132db450",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要参赛了……？\r\n你应该是有什么想法\r\n才这么决定的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da765f0c081ae8a0e0a88d485c9f6f6708889940900b74a8c2464bd6371bde00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85be7ea156c63dc821c2b985",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比赛这种东西并不是多多益善……\r\n你该不会连这都不明白吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdfad44db0e4e7ec6e1312f247efdc163eda5ddf41d92d902165e6a3fabb41e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab67d759902bd5ac9a5133c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在的状态非常好，\r\n想必结果也会相当理想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f4b208adda174b3d66f569bb00362dc21c3ed5a62aef99e8f8df455d9e65e94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c58eec4b9fb763fa3abc5668",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论对手是谁都不重要。\r\n我会让她们都成为\r\n我迈向理想的垫脚石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d75199629a3ec87db8fc82bf74f0dc1c6e40be5acfd97ddaf38e8c0f762dd524",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70635b01e5faaef6e26e113c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵……这怎么行，\r\n我竟然受到会场气氛的影响，\r\n情绪跟着高涨了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbc1b8f392f2e70627b8520775aebc9666d7b82e2b8172e1cd5fa51e3c44cbf6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e324695cd4c5b10685224f92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用这双脚，\r\n开拓出通往胜利的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85468dd149762fde5d3b81c7e0c3c4799e096a6f3d74bc552ced88b3b58bdb21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc796f5f5683c68fa473edb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锻炼的成果显现出来了，\r\n这样结果也显而易见了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e70d1751180ef40a09148e30b90e930c963e59366e7ca04f9aaaa19ad7ae16d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ced3fc351ca8eb336868d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！\r\n让后面的选手们看看我的背影吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68b2978596448e748c6a79254746d7101eb95b759578406c9303108c65ddddb2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1461a917f14561d9ebbffd19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态并不差。\r\n我会在比赛中抓住取胜的机会，\r\n把所有人都甩在后头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab8943007f47e33442275e771b2a16f0a31e954b89f684bf3c922f214928f7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:960b77186929e00b2aabaae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天和平时的状态一样。\r\n只需要掌握到比赛的节奏就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5cb3ff6140d96789eec073b3b0082e0c7d87b470b054ee64853cf4ce829c7b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2542eddc4a9a277bfc3d5194",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来是可以发挥出平时的水平。\r\n……一旦找到机会，我就会直奔胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc3450efca290b7ab857f0e0172c3e5f2cab9993cd05ab9bd0d4e86fcce95b99",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb3aa85375576a29c86c3b98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态虽然不算好，但……\r\n哈，这样反而更值得努力去争取。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35b7b65bcb57fdf19ebe80181e2894b2c909b022d8c2728533c6c75fc1984e91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53652ac4fb2968444216ba74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须好好切换心态才行。\r\n……要是跑出难看的成绩，\r\n我可没脸面对母亲了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9af37aa022c9b733c5008584de5adbc85976aa6c3416a877e151db58e9bf6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:510bcf7a8e8eca6e07909428",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不好……\r\n我也不会放弃，只要专注勇往直前。\r\n这才是「女帝」该有的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "63af6082a5b103b8c21c79e875f4dfe09cb592f55fe8d2f282729c0314343dbd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c659a40aba74f312d2b87701",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没能调整到万全的状态……\r\n这就像是场恶梦，\r\n但我不会被恶梦打败的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1bb4728411ce1d884ac7be03a62dc14563272e3d868ba2a5d97f97c60299c83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1018",
        "20035"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
